-- Load all AI-generated cloze cards into the flashcards table (Text field).
-- The question itself (Lecture Notes) is built from the static question data at
-- export time, so only the cloze is stored here. Re-runnable.

on conflict (question_id) do update set cloze_text = excluded.cloze_text, updated_at = now();
