('2016-258','Of the major hormones, {{c1::cortisol}} shows a strong {{c2::circadian}} release pattern, peaking in the early morning.',''),
('2016-259','Inability to dress despite intact strength, sensation, and coordination is {{c1::(dressing) apraxia}}.',''),
