('2016-267','Offering quicker discharge contingent on accepting medication undermines the {{c1::voluntariness}} component of informed consent (it is coercive).',''),
('2016-268','Genome-wide association studies (GWAS) assay {{c1::common genetic variants (SNPs)}} across the whole genome.',''),
('2016-269','{{c1::Transient global amnesia}} causes abrupt anterograde amnesia that typically resolves within {{c2::24 hours}} with normal imaging and no recurrence.',''),
('2016-27','For somatic symptom disorder, the recommended management is {{c1::regularly scheduled visits with a single provider}} rather than reactive testing or referrals.',''),
