('2016-283','Deliberate, repeated fire-setting with pre-event excitement and post-event relief, done for its own sake, defines {{c1::pyromania}}.',''),
('2016-284','Whether a defendant met the legal criteria for insanity is ultimately decided by the {{c1::jury (trier of fact)}}, not by experts.',''),
('2016-285','A major goal of the initial phase of interpersonal psychotherapy is {{c1::taking an interpersonal inventory}} of the patient''s significant relationships.',''),
