('2020-239','The {{c1::Mental Health Parity and Addiction Equity Act}} bars insurers from imposing more restrictive limits on behavioral than on medical benefits.',''),
('2020-24','Involuntary outpatient commitment is most effective when paired with {{c1::assertive community treatment}}.',''),
