('2020-57','In a pregnant patient failing antidepressants, {{c1::continuous suicidal ideation with a plan}} supports moving to ECT.',''),
('2020-58','Being raised in {{c1::disadvantaged neighborhoods}} is most strongly associated with adolescent high-risk behaviors.',''),
('2020-59','Distributing naloxone to reduce overdose deaths among active opioid users is a {{c1::harm reduction}} strategy.',''),
('2020-6','The {{c1::federal government}}, via IDEA, mandates that public schools provide educational services to children with identified disabilities.',''),
('2020-60','Mesolimbic dopamine neurons projecting to the nucleus accumbens have their cell bodies in the {{c1::ventral tegmental area}}.',''),
('2020-61','{{c1::Semantic}} memory stores general facts and knowledge independent of personal experience.',''),
('2020-62','A foundational principle of general systems theory is that {{c1::a change affecting one part of the family affects the whole}}.',''),
('2020-63','Legal competency (as opposed to clinical capacity) is ultimately determined only by a {{c1::judicial hearing}}, not by psychiatric assessment alone.',''),
